nisha [B] an,        [G#m] Hoo
[B] Jeena hai [A] mar jaana hai,        [B] Kuch aisa [A] kar jaana hai
[B] Zinda [A] rahe pyaar ki das [B] taan,        das [G#m] taan
Teri zinda [C#m] gi...        [C#m] Dil pe khayalon ki baraf jami hai
